# What stays out of the .vsix: sources, configuration and tests. What ships is
# dist/extension.js with its source map - debugging a host surprise is hard enough
# without one - and everything esbuild puts under media/: the built viewer, and the
# examples `Try an Example` writes out for a reader who has nothing of their own yet.
src/**
test/**
tsconfig.json
esbuild.mjs
.vscodeignore
icon.svg
